{"version":1,"content":"<p>朱咪咪將於明年1月在伊利沙伯體育館舉行兩場《「又嚟開」慈善演唱會》，她在今天（3日）舉行的記者會上，宣布邀得黎耀祥及葉振棠擔任嘉賓。</p><p>對於近日因身形消瘦而引起健康揣測，現年72歲的她強調不介意肥或瘦，最緊要健康。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:36.487886+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:24.046094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.044516+00:00","content_hash":"bc949445ff4eaa23cd4431529c0d8aaaa43359dc25ba4aede49e37d00f07d191","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}